trusted module release

--- An HMAC under the `pepper` key reveals nothing about the address to whoever lacks the key.
pub policy keyed_hash
  from secret Hashed
  to internal Hashed
  via as_keyed
  purpose "compare an e-mail address with the allowlist only as its HMAC under the pepper key"
  owner security_team

as_keyed(h: secret Hashed) -> internal Hashed = h
